  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e0a651ed53a8df42bbae8b8c32911db, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoadingTipsUI
  tipText: {fileID: 1025147064}
  tips:
  - Press Sprint + Ctrl to slide and surprise your enemies.
  - "Press Q to perform a quick dash \u2014 the best way to dodge incoming bullets."
  - The Shotgun deals massive damage at close range, but it's weak from a distance.
  - "The Rifle is fully automatic \u2014 hold the fire button for continuous shooting."
  - After respawning, you get a 2.5-second shield, keeping you safe for a short time.
  - If you avoid taking damage for 4 seconds, your health will automatically regenerate.
  - Press R to reload, or your weapon will reload automatically when the magazine
    is empty.
  - "Press 1, 2, or 3 to switch weapons \u2014 each weapon has its own strengths
    and strategy."
  - "Use cover wisely \u2014 enemies can't hit what they can't see."
  - "Pay attention to your team's color \u2014 friendly fire is disabled, but don't
    mistake teammates for enemies."
